      "reference": "European Commission JRC, ILCD Handbook General guide for LCA, Detailed guidance, first edition March2010, section7.9.3, printed pp.257–258; https://eplca.jrc.ec.europa.eu/uploads/ILCD-Handbook-General-guide-for-LCA-DETAILED-GUIDANCE-12March2010-ISBN-fin-v1.0-EN.pdf",
